// Iron ore. Generated as a threshold in the density pass, not as a structure
// (PHASE2_ARCHITECTURE.md §6) -- it replaces stone and never surfaces.
//
// Yields raw iron, not the ore block -- and only to a stone pick or better
// (§4's tiers: 0 hand, 1 wood, 2 stone, 3 iron). A wooden pick still breaks
// it, it just gets nothing, which is how the rule teaches itself.
Material(
    name:   "cubara:iron_ore",
    solid:  true,
    faces:  All("iron_ore"),
    shapes: [Full],
    drops:  Item((item: "cubara:raw_iron", count: 1)),
    requires_tier: 2,
)
